"so it includes %2$s:"
msgstr ""
"Tu registro SPF no menciona %1$s. Muchos servicios solo necesitan sus "
"registros DKIM, pero si la configuración de su dominio pide SPF, edita tu "
"registro existente para que incluya %2$s:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:372
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:431
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:452
msgid "Name / host"
msgstr "Nombre / host"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:376
msgid ""
"Edit the record you already have. A domain may only have one SPF record; a "
"second one breaks both."
msgstr ""
"Edita el registro que ya tienes. Un dominio solo puede tener un registro "
"SPF; un segundo registro rompe ambos."

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:385
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Add this record to %s. It says your web server, your mail server and your "
"sending service may send email for the domain."
msgstr ""
"Añade este registro a %s. Indica que tu servidor web, tu servidor de correo "
"y tu servicio de envío pueden enviar correo en nombre del dominio."

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:390
#, php-format
msgid "Name / host (@ means %s)"
msgstr "Nombre / host (@ significa %s)"

#. translators: %s: service name
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:396
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This already includes %s, which looks like the service sending your mail."
msgstr "Esto ya incluye %s, que parece ser el servicio que envía tu correo."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:404
msgid ""
"Send through a service or a hosted mailbox? Add its include just before "
"<code>~all</code>:"
msgstr ""
"¿Envías a través de un servicio o un buzón alojado? Añade su include justo "
"antes de <code>~all</code>:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:406
msgid ""
"Already have a TXT record starting with <code>v=spf1</code>? Edit that one "
"instead. A domain may only have one SPF record."
msgstr ""
"¿Ya tienes un registro TXT que empieza por <code>v=spf1</code>? Edita ese en "
"su lugar. Un dominio solo puede tener un registro SPF."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:417
msgid ""
"DKIM records hold a unique key, so you copy them from whoever sends your "
"email rather than typing one yourself. Get it here:"
msgstr ""
"Los registros DKIM contienen una clave única, así que los copias de quien "
"envía tu correo en lugar de escribir uno tú mismo. Consíguelo aquí:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:420
msgid "(looks like yours):"
msgstr "(parece el tuyo):"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:422
msgid "Email with your web host (cPanel):"
msgstr "Correo con tu proveedor de alojamiento web (cPanel):"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:422
msgid ""
"Email › Email Deliverability › Manage next to your domain. If your DNS is at "
"the same host, press \"Install the suggested record\"."
msgstr ""
"Email › Email Deliverability › Manage junto a tu dominio. Si tu DNS está en "
"el mismo proveedor, pulsa \"Install the suggested record\"."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:423
msgid "Add the record, wait an hour, then press \"Start authentication\"."
msgstr ""
"Añade el registro, espera una hora y luego pulsa \"Start authentication\"."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:424
msgid "Add the two CNAME records it shows, then turn signing on."
msgstr "Añade los dos registros CNAME que se muestran y luego activa la firma."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:425
msgid "Sending services (Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon SES, Postmark):"
msgstr "Servicios de envío (Brevo, SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon SES, Postmark):"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:425
msgid ""
"look for \"Domain authentication\" or \"Verify domain\". They list two or "
"three records to add."
msgstr ""
"busca \"Domain authentication\" o \"Verify domain\". Indican dos o tres "
"registros para añadir."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:427
msgid "The record you add looks like this:"
msgstr "El registro que añades tiene este aspecto:"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:430
msgid "TXT or CNAME (as given)"
msgstr "TXT o CNAME (según se indique)"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:432
msgid "the long text from your provider"
msgstr "el texto largo de tu proveedor"

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:435
msgid ""
"We look for common selector names (default, google, selector1, k1, s1…). If "
"your provider uses a different name, DKIM may already work even though this "
"still shows a warning."
msgstr ""
"Buscamos nombres de selector habituales (default, google, selector1, k1, "
"s1…). Si tu proveedor usa un nombre distinto, DKIM puede que ya funcione "
"aunque esto siga mostrando una advertencia."

#. translators: %s: domain
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:448
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Add this record to %s. It only watches: it never blocks your mail, and it "
"sends you reports on who is sending as your domain."
msgstr ""
"Añade este registro a %s. Solo observa: nunca bloquea tu correo y te envía "
"informes sobre quién envía en nombre de tu dominio."

#. translators: 1: full record name, 2: report address
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:457
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Some DNS hosts want the full name, %1$s. Reports go to %2$s; change it to "
"any mailbox you read."
msgstr ""
"Algunos proveedores de DNS piden el nombre completo, %1$s. Los informes se "
"envían a %2$s; cámbialo a cualquier buzón que leas."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:458
msgid ""
"Set up SPF and DKIM first. After a few weeks of clean reports you can change "
"<code>p=none</code> to <code>p=quarantine</code> for extra protection."
msgstr ""
"Configura primero SPF y DKIM. Después de unas semanas de informes limpios "
"puedes cambiar <code>p=none</code> por <code>p=quarantine</code> para mayor "
"protección."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:465
msgid "How to check another way"
msgstr "Cómo comprobarlo de otra forma"

#. translators: %s: link to Google Admin Toolbox
#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:470
#, php-format
msgid "Open %s, enter your domain and read the SPF, DKIM and DMARC results."
msgstr ""
"Abre %s, introduce tu dominio y lee los resultados de SPF, DKIM y DMARC."

#: admin/inc/wp_easycart_admin_email_help.php:470
