#: admin/template/products/products/product-import-v2.php:83
msgid ""
"One row per product with every product field, plus categories ( category "
"ids ), price_tiers ( quantity,price pairs ), b2b_prices ( role,price pairs ) "
"and advanced_option_ids. Open it in a spreadsheet, change what you need and "
