"Shipping Rate Setup ERROR: Please visit the WP EasyCart -> Settings -> "
"Shipping Rates and add at least one shipping method for your selected live "
"based shipping company. If you have done this and are still seeing this "
"error, then likely there is a setup error in the live based company "
"settings. Feel free to contact us at www.wpeasycart.com to get help "
"troubleshooting."
